以为佳辄语樊阿，阿又秘之；近者人见阿之寿而气力强盛怪之，遂责阿所服，因醉乱误道之；法一施人多服者皆有大验","accounts":[{"id":"fangji-a-cc5f8cfaf0e73c11d91c","label":"裴注·佗别传","text":"华佗以为佳辄语樊阿，阿又秘之；近者人见阿之寿而气力强盛怪之，遂责阿所服，因醉乱误道之；法一施人多服者皆有大验","evidence":["fangji-q-a7b2713107693d7228d4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0407","role":"语方者","evidence":["fangji-q-a7b2713107693d7228d4"]},{"person":"fangji-p-9e47e66afcfcde","role":"秘方误道者","evidence":["fangji-q-a7b2713107693d7228d4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["fangji-q-a7b2713107693d7228d4"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-a7b2713107693d7228d4","order":5912}],"persons":[{"id":"fangji-p-9e47e66afcfcde","name":"樊阿","evidence":["fangji-q-fae455c434a33933c703","fangji-q-1a76d53a88edf8248d55","fangji-q-a7b2713107693d7228d4","fangji-q-c26b13d6d04ad898be9d","fangji-q-6ceff68aaa4b9af2f106","fangji-q-74036f38c3f65746a6f7"],"facts":[{"id":"fangji-f-2512361d7e518cbd4953","text":"彭城人，华佗弟子。","evidence":["fangji-q-6ceff68aaa4b9af2f106"]},{"id":"fangji-f-6fe6945ead301a3cebf6","text":"本传记从华佗服食之言而寿百余岁；不据此推生卒年。","evidence":["fangji-q-74036f38c3f65746a6f7"]}],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"fangji-q-1a76d53a88edf8248d55","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-bc692ba43f977cfda2ab","layer":"original","quote":"阿从佗求可服食益于人者，佗授以漆叶青黏散〖12〗：漆叶屑一升，青黏屑十四两，以是为率〖13〗；言“久服去三虫〖14〗，利五藏〖15〗，轻体，使人头不白","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":67,"end":142},{"id":"fangji-q-6ceff68aaa4b9af2f106","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-1aa028ba198ab5f85bb6","layer":"original","quote":"广陵吴普，彭城樊阿，皆从佗学。","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":127,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15},{"id":"fangji-q-74036f38c3f65746a6f7","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-bc692ba43f977cfda2ab","layer":"original","quote":"阿善针术。凡医咸言：“背及胸藏之间不可妄针〖9〗，针之不过四分。”而阿针，背入一二寸，巨阙胸藏针下五六寸〖10〗，而病辄皆瘳〖11〗。阿从佗求可服食益于人者，佗授以漆叶青黏散〖12〗：漆叶屑一升，青黏屑十四两，以是为率〖13〗；言“久服去三虫〖14〗，利五藏〖15〗，轻体，使人头不白”。阿从其言，寿百余岁。漆叶，处所而有〖16〗；青黏，生于丰、沛、彭城及朝歌云〖17〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":189},{"id":"fangji-q-a7b2713107693d7228d4","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-d109820d62c6bab69d15","layer":"pei","quote":"佗以为佳，辄语阿，阿又秘之。近者人见阿之寿而气力强盛，怪之；遂责阿所服，因醉乱，误道之。法一施，人多服者，皆有大验","attribution":"裴注·佗别传","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":149,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-66c2e7fedf68bad14c99","start":52,"end":109},{"id":"fangji-q-c26b13d6d04ad898be9d","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-bc692ba43f977cfda2ab","layer":"original","quote":"阿善针术。凡医咸言：“背及胸藏之间不可妄针〖9〗，针之不过四分。”而阿针，背入一二寸，巨阙胸藏针下五六寸〖10〗，而病辄皆瘳〖11〗。","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67},{"id":"fangji-q-fae455c434a33933c703","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-1aa028ba198ab5f85bb6","layer":"original","quote":"广陵吴普，彭城樊阿，皆从佗学","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":127,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
